OL,3,AIsrael's new parliament to be sworn in
OL,4,Aas leaders compete to form government
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael's new parliament will be sworn
OL,7,Fin on Tuesday, as opposition leader
OL,8,FGadi Eisenkot seeks to oust caretaker
OL,9,FPrime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu.
OL,11,FThe former army chief was tasked with
OL,12,Fforming a government by the president,
OL,13,Fafter he received the backing of 67
OL,14,Fmembers of the 120-seat Knesset,
OL,15,Fcompared to 46 for Netanyahu.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
