OL,3,AIsrael's new parliament to be sworn in
OL,4,Aas leaders compete to form government
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Eisenkot faces an uphill struggle.
OL,7,FHis bloc of four parties won 48 seats
OL,8,Fin last month's election, while
OL,9,FNetanyahu's bloc won 53, leaving both
OL,10,Fshort of a majority. He has 28 days to
OL,11,Fbuild a coalition, with a possible
OL,12,Ftwo-week extension.
OL,14,FAlmost half of the MKs being sworn in
OL,15,Fdid not serve in the previous
OL,16,Fparliament, while Arab-led parties have
OL,17,Fa record number of seats.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
